        {"zh": "你无法抵抗我的力量...", "en": "You cannot resist my power..."},
        {"zh": "你的挣扎徒劳无功...", "en": "Your struggles are futile..."},
        {"zh": "我将把你拖向深渊...", "en": "I will drag you into the abyss..."},
        {"zh": "先咬腿，你就走不掉了。", "en": "The leg first, then you cannot walk."},
        {"zh": "血会一直流，止不住。", "en": "The blood keeps running and will not stop."},
        {"zh": "被咬过的人，救不回来。", "en": "Once bitten, no one is saved."},
        {"zh": "抓住手腕，往下拖。", "en": "I grab the wrist and pull you down."},
        {"zh": "我不用跑，你总会慢下来。", "en": "I need not run; you will slow."},
        {"zh": "贴着墙走，别让你看见。", "en": "I keep to the wall so you cannot see me."},
        {"zh": "拖着一条腿，也要走近你。", "en": "Dragging one leg, I still close the gap."},
        {"zh": "你身后只有砖了，继续退。", "en": "Only brick is left behind you. Keep backing up."}
      ]
    },
