        {"zh": "腐臭的触手缠绕", "en": "Rotten tentacles entwine"},
        {"zh": "腐烂的血液滴落", "en": "Rotten blood drips down"},
        {"zh": "腐烂的骨骼碰撞", "en": "Rotting bones clash"},
        {"zh": "手指抠进你的肩膀！", "en": "My fingers dig into your shoulder!"},
        {"zh": "牙齿咬住小腿不松！", "en": "My teeth clamp your calf and hold!"},
